WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.999
No surface in 3D fits.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.905
Analytic rules always fit near a point.

3
00:00:04.905 --> 00:00:06.710
For smooth ones, it was open.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.342
Shrinking patches flip curvature; on one, a saddle argument breaks any fit.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.832
Claimed: no neighbourhood fits in three dimensions.

6
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.646
Checked in Lean.
